
# Lunchbag

>  Bring Lunch With You!

---
A &blunchbag&r, upgradeable to an iron or gold lunchbox, is a handy-dandy way to carry a variety of foods with you wherever you go. You can &aeat the lunchbox directly&r for a randomised snack from its interior- an excellent way to easily &aincrease your food variety score&r, which increases your hearts!

A word of warning... don't trust seagulls. They'll swoop down and &asteal food right out of your inventory&r; even your whole lunchbox! 

&dCaution: entering Creative Mode with the lunchbox in your inventory will cause its contents to be wiped.&r
            